---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---
<BaseLayout lang={lang} title="Privacy Policy | Salud CBO" description="Privacy policy for Salud CBO. How we collect, use and protect your personal data." noIndex>

  <section class="bg-brand-50 py-16 border-b border-brand-100">
    <div class="container-main max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500">Last updated: July 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-main max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-gray prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed max-w-none">

      <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Controller:</strong> Carlos Bernardo Osoro (Salud CBO)</li>
        <li><strong>Address:</strong> P. El Castro, nave 2, Lugones, Asturias, Spain</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> cbo.salud@gmail.com</li>
        <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +34 667 828 851</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Data we collect and purposes</h2>
      <p>We only collect data that you voluntarily provide through the website contact form:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Name and surname</strong> — to identify you and address you correctly.</li>
        <li><strong>Email address and/or phone number</strong> — to respond to your enquiry or request.</li>
        <li><strong>Message</strong> — to understand your enquiry and provide appropriate guidance.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not collect special category data (health, ideology, etc.) through web forms. If you voluntarily share health information to request advice, we will treat it with particular confidentiality.</p>

      <h2>3. Legal basis for processing</h2>
      <p>The processing of your data is based on the consent you provide by completing and submitting the contact form, in accordance with Art. 6(1)(a) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR).</p>

      <h2>4. Retention period</h2>
      <p>We will retain your data for as long as necessary to handle your enquiry and, where applicable, manage the business relationship, or until you request deletion. In any case, no longer than 3 years from the last contact.</p>

      <h2>5. Recipients</h2>
      <p>Your data will not be shared with third parties except where legally required. We use email service providers (Resend) who act as data processors and have adequate GDPR safeguards in place.</p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may exercise the following rights at any time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> find out what data we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
        <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> request deletion of your data.</li>
        <li><strong>Restriction:</strong> request restriction of processing.</li>
        <li><strong>Portability:</strong> receive your data in a structured format.</li>
        <li><strong>Objection:</strong> object to the processing of your data.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, send an email to <a href="mailto:cbo.salud@gmail.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">cbo.salud@gmail.com</a> with the subject line "GDPR Rights" and indicate the right you wish to exercise. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the <a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">Spanish Data Protection Authority (AEPD)</a>.</p>

      <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website uses technically necessary cookies for its operation. See our <a href="/en/cookie-policy" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">Cookie Policy</a> for more information.</p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
